// Seki Senshi, ADR-0032: observation hooks, `hook_<kind>_<n>`, for the hook table in the sim content.
// Each one is an overheard guard line (bark), a mail on a terminal or the contents of a shard.
// One or two lines, no choices. Each reveals a systemic way through: a gap in a rotation, a code,
// a habit of the target. Mails and shards are narration, so they carry no speaker prefix.

// eliminate: Kaito's sites on Krakowskie Przedmieście and under the Grodzka footbridge in Stare Miasto.
=== hook_eliminate_1 ===
HEBI: Every hour the boss goes behind the car wash alone. Says he's calling his mother, comes back smelling of sake.
-> END

=== hook_eliminate_2 ===
Shard, voice memo: "Guard change at two. Whoever's on the street side goes for ramen then, and for ten minutes the boss is left with one kid."
-> END

// delivery: Kaito's cold modules for Hana.
=== hook_delivery_1 ===
Mail on a terminal. From: Neon Koi cold room. Subject: modules. "The package holds its temperature in the shade. The footbridge over Grodzka is covered and faster than the street below, where the Hebi stand."
-> END

=== hook_delivery_2 ===
HEBI: We grab couriers under the footbridge. We don't go up top, because Kenji's scared of heights and nobody wants to go first.
-> END

// retrieve: Hana's crate at the Hebi stash, east end of the market.
=== hook_retrieve_1 ===
HEBI: Two of us watch the crate, but after midnight Daisuke goes to Fumiko's for ramen. Back in fifteen, if there's no line.
-> END

=== hook_retrieve_2 ===
Shard, Hebi note: "From the viaduct you can see the stash plain as day. The stairs up are on the west, by the north row. The boys at the crate only watch the gap between the stalls."
-> END

// protect: Hebi coming for Oyaji's stall. _1 fits the raid from the east wall, _2 the one from under the viaduct.
=== hook_protect_1 ===
HEBI: We hit the old man from the east wall, same as always. Why change what works.
-> END

=== hook_protect_2 ===
Mail on Hana's terminal. From: unknown. Subject: Oyaji. "The Hebi will come down from under the viaduct. From the fire-stair landing over the first stall you can see the whole aisle, and they never look up."
-> END

// escort: Mika's way from the yard to the boat.
=== hook_escort_1 ===
STRAZNIK: When the bookkeeper heads for the riverside, we wait by the office. Orders are nobody stands on the pier, they can see us from the water there.
-> END

=== hook_escort_2 ===
Mail on the Tessen security terminal. Subject: night roster. "East alley of the container yard unmanned between 1:00 and 3:00, patrol moved to the office."
-> END

// infiltrate: the manifests on the desk in the Tessen office.
=== hook_infiltrate_1 ===
Mail on a terminal. From: Nabrzeże administration. Subject: office door. "Code for the side door on the crane side changed to 4177. Please do not write it on sticky notes." The code is written on a sticky note.
-> END

=== hook_infiltrate_2 ===
STRAZNIK: The guy on the office door goes for a smoke behind the warehouse every half hour. Thinks the camera doesn't reach there. He's right.
-> END

// hack: holding the Tessen terminal under the riverside crane against the wave and the sniper.
=== hook_hack_1 ===
Shard, rifle service report: "The shooter on the warehouse roof swaps the cell after the third shot. Four seconds without the laser."
-> END

=== hook_hack_2 ===
STRAZNIK: From the warehouse roof you can't see a thing under the crane's boom. If someone hides there, the sniper can only look.
-> END
